orn-in-as-paraguay-president-after-santiago-penas-impeachment","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Business","title":"U.S. adds 165,000 jobs in October, far above forecasts","summary":"Payrolls beat expectations of roughly 59,000 and earlier months were revised up. Unemployment fell to 4.1% and wages rose 0.4% on the month, keeping a December Fed rate hike in play.","source":"USA Today via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/blowout-jobs-report-rescues-stocks-185650732.html","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n5","cat":"World","title":"New Zealand election too close to call as votes are counted","summary":"With just over 42% counted, Chris Hipkins's Labour led Prime Minister Christopher Luxon's National 29.71% to 29.41%. The Greens had about 14%, ACT 10.6% and NZ First 9.4%; no party is expected to win a majority.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/new-zealand-counts-votes-in-razor-thin-election-after-campaign-centred-on-cost-of-living","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n6","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI reportedly raises $11B at a $1.25 trillion valuation","summary":"Bloomberg reports OpenAI has raised $11 billion so far in a round that could reach about $20 billion, short of the $30 billion it reportedly targeted in September.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/openai-reportedly-raises-an-additional-11-billion-at-a-1-25-trillion-valuation/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n7","cat":"Canada","title":"U.S. sanctions 8 Canadian firms linked to Iran and Ryan Wedding","summary":"The U.S. Treasury, coordinating with FINTRAC, sanctioned eight Canadian businesses, including money services firms in B.C. and Ontario, over alleged Iran sanctions evasion. Some allegedly laundered drug money for accused trafficker Ryan Wedding.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12140771/us-canada-sanctions-iran-ryan-wedding/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n8","cat":"World","title":"EU leaders reject U.S.-Russia security deal covering 'all of Europe'","summary":"European officials pushed back after Trump touted a broad security arrangement with Russia ahead of renewed Ukraine talks in Abu Dhabi. EU foreign policy chief Kaja Kallas said Europe already has a security architecture in place.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/eu-rejects-trumps-big-beautiful-security-deal-with-russia-and-all-of-europe","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Major","title":"U.S. measles cases top 5,000, highest in 35 years","summary":"The CDC has confirmed 5,182 measles cases in 2026, more than double 2025's 2,289 and the most since 1991. States have reported at least eight deaths.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/us-measles-cases-exceed-5000-in-2026-reaching-their-highest-level-in-35-years","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n10","cat":"Canada","title":"Joly asks Competition Bureau to probe Stelco owner over layoffs","summary":"Industry Minister Melanie Joly wants the bureau to examine Cleveland-Cliffs after about 500 layoff notices at Stelco's Hamilton plant. Ottawa warns of legal action, possibly forcing a sale, if layoffs aren't reversed within 15 days.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12140292/joly-stelco-investigation/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n11","cat":"AI","title":"Ramp data shows business AI spending stalling ahead of Anthropic IPO","summary":"Token spending rose just 1.5% across August and September after a 42% jump in July, as price cuts and cost controls cap revenue. Anthropic's potential valuation was reportedly put at $1.2-1.3 trillion, down from $2 trillion.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/ramp-data-shows-ai-spending-stalling-just-as-anthropic-nears-its-ipo/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n12","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney says he hasn't spoken with U.S. Democrats about tariffs","summary":"Asked whether he had talked to Democrats about ending tariffs on Canada, Carney said no. The tariffs were imposed by executive order, so Trump keeps control even with Democrats taking Congress in January.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12140323/carney-us-trade-democrats/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n13","cat":"Business","title":"DraftKings sinks about 21% on weak 2027 outlook","summary":"DraftKings cut 2026 adjusted EBITDA guidance to $175-275 million from at least $700 million, citing prediction-markets spending. Its $900 million 2027 outlook missed the $1.12 billion consensus.","source":"Barchart via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/draftkings-sinks-weak-2027-guidance-215130897.html","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n14","cat":"AI","title":"Google buys Crusoe's Wyoming data center project, plans $17B investment","summary":"Crusoe sold its unfinished southeastern Wyoming campus, once planned to scale to 10 gigawatts, to Google for an undisclosed price. Google plans to invest $17 billion in the site.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/crusoe-sells-troubled-wyoming-data-center-project-to-google/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n15","cat":"Canada","title":"Mother and daughter killed in suspected grizzly attack near Bella Coola","summary":"Jenny Balcarras and Selah Reed were found dead after being reported missing Sunday on B.C.'s central coast. Conservation officers believe several grizzlies may be involved; trapping is underway and a curfew is in place.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/06/grizzly-bear-hunt-underway-after-mother-and-daughter-killed-in-canada","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n16","cat":"Major","title":"AI-designed vaccine protects against many bird flu strains in animals","summary":"Cambridge scientists report in Cell Reports Medicine that their AI-designed vaccine fully protected mice and ferrets against varied H5 variants. Only half survived with the WHO's existing vaccine.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/scientists-develop-first-ever-broad-spectrum-bird-flu-vaccine-using-ai","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"Meta launches Spaces for working with its Muse AI agent","summary":"Spaces are topic-focused sidebar conversations where Muse works toward a goal, such as trip planning, and keeps them updated using data from connected apps.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/meta-introduces-spaces-a-new-way-to-collaborate-with-your-muse-agent/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n18","cat":"Major","title":"Polar vortex weakens unusually early, raising cold-spell risk","summary":"Meteorologists are tracking a sudden stratospheric warming in November, earlier than ever observed. It could raise the risk of cold snaps across North America, Europe and Asia, though impacts are uncertain.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/polar-vortex-weakens-weeks-ahead-of-schedule-raising-risk-of-cold-spells","published":"2026-11-06"}]}